href "/athletes/59819"} "Ştefan Rusu"] ", Olympic gold medalist in 1976 and 1980 as a lightweight. In round two of Group B, however, Rusu lost to Finland’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/57986"} "Jouko Salomäki"] " and Salomäki would win the group and head to the gold medal match against Sweden’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/60135"} "Roger Tallroth"] ", silver medalist at the 1982 European Championships. Salomäki opened a big lead, 5-0, in the final, but Tallroth fought back and made it close, eventually losing, 5-4. Rusu did manage to win the bronze medal match over Korean " [:a {:href "/athletes/59198"} "Kim Yeong-Nam"] " on points, 6-1. Mamiashvili would compete at the 1988 Olympics, winning the middleweight gold medal."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Round Eliminated"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Classification Points", :class "footnote"} "CP"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "64"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/57986"} "Jouko Salomäki"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FIN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FIN.png"}] "FIN"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "228"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60135"} "Roger Tallroth"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "208"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/59819"} "Ștefan Rusu"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ROU"} [:img {:style "